        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 7:47AM EDT until September 26 at 11:00AM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 25 to 35 mph with gusts up to 45 to 50 mph
expected.

* WHERE...In Maryland, Inland Worcester and Maryland Beaches
Counties. In Virginia, Northampton and Accomack Counties.

* WHEN...From 5 PM this afternoon to 11 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
